{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overplay Crosshair</strong> is a sleek, standalone overlay app designed for FPS players who value precision and control. It offers a streamlined way to <strong>customize, switch, and share crosshair setups</strong> with minimal effort, all without interfering with gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Crosshair Designer</strong> \u2013 Build your perfect reticle with layered shapes, colors, opacity, and rotation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preset System with Keybind Switching</strong> \u2013 Instantly swap between loadouts mid-game using hotkeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save/Load Codes</strong> \u2013 Share your crosshair builds with friends or the community in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipboard &amp; Image Export</strong> \u2013 Copy your setup or generate a clean image for Discord, guides, or any other use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Textured UI Panels</strong> \u2013 A visual identity that stands out from generic overlays \u2014 sleek, sharp, and modern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Input Lag</strong> \u2013 Designed for competitive play with minimal system impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overplay Crosshair is completely free.  <br>Want to support development? Grab the optional <strong>Supporter Pack DLC</strong> and help shape future features.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922340?t=1757518016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922340/3781df2c38290f19f27d30e3ead7b30002399724/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757518016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922340/aa6dd7007fe99eee2df2d4cb5926ea3d9d53d17c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757518016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922340/aa6dd7007fe99eee2df2d4cb5926ea3d9d53d17c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757518016","categories":[{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overplay Crosshair</strong> is a sleek, standalone overlay app designed for FPS players who value precision and control. It offers a streamlined way to <strong>customize, switch, and share crosshair setups</strong> with minimal effort, all without interfering with gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Crosshair Designer</strong> \u2013 Build your perfect reticle with layered shapes, colors, opacity, and rotation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preset System with Keybind Switching</strong> \u2013 Instantly swap between loadouts mid-game using hotkeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save/Load Codes</strong> \u2013 Share your crosshair builds with friends or the community in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipboard &amp; Image Export</strong> \u2013 Copy your setup or generate a clean image for Discord, guides, or any other use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Textured UI Panels</strong> \u2013 A visual identity that stands out from generic overlays \u2014 sleek, sharp, and modern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Input Lag</strong> \u2013 Designed for competitive play with minimal system impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overplay Crosshair is completely free.  <br>Want to support development? Grab the optional <strong>Supporter Pack DLC</strong> and help shape future features.</p>","developers":["Devalor"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922340/73a6c8aff93a4fa9ee7133efb9779a7bf293ffd1/header.jpg?t=1757518016","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922340/2123137321/43785882613b08082676bb353f4d3397a2725803/1756353030/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757467010","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922340/2123137321/43785882613b08082676bb353f4d3397a2725803/1756353030/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757467010","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922340/2123137321/43785882613b08082676bb353f4d3397a2725803/1756353030/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757467010","id":257190048,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190048/movie480.mp4?t=1757467010","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190048/movie_max.mp4?t=1757467010"},"name":"Overplay Crosshair Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190048/b40168101849e10aca9fc23a8590afb22ce22940/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757467010","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190048/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757467010","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190048/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757467010"}}],"name":"Overplay Crosshair","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong